                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d174d5be-db61-49e9-857d-910e787bc7bd",
                        "source_entry_id": "9eb4bf22-7828-39af-a061-3864974d8bec",
                        "source_sense_id": "be531c89-9be7-3ba5-a833-7df7c6fcc176",
                        "target_lang_word": "ampelography",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "ampelography",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f396335d-f04e-3705-b0d7-b7d2fca400f3",
                                        "entry_id": "92a73490-5699-3b99-b0b3-556da2a5414e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The discipline within botany concerned with the taxonomy of cultivars in the grapevine genus, Vitis."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "82d063b8-343c-464c-a9c9-17b24477fdbf",
                                                "sense_id": "f396335d-f04e-3705-b0d7-b7d2fca400f3",
                                                "text": "She is the American apostle of Pierre Galet, a Frenchman whose internationally recognized contribution to ampelography, or the science of classifying grape vines, rests on identifying leaf design and the appearance of a vine's growing tips."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bfd692a8-ce51-4aba-9ba0-ff4dbd9eae3e",
                                                "sense_id": "f396335d-f04e-3705-b0d7-b7d2fca400f3",
                                                "text": "Scientists are just now devising a genetic test to distinguish one rootstock from another. Until they do, the only recourse is the arcane art of ampelography, in which the vines are identified by physical appearance. Like art authenticators, ampelographers practice a craft that they would have others think is a science."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e643a8ec-4e85-473f-ad6e-79fb5811b226",
                                                "sense_id": "f396335d-f04e-3705-b0d7-b7d2fca400f3",
                                                "text": "The mainstay of grapevine identification is the science of ampelography, and manuals of ampelography (Galet 1971) are the major resource for grapevine identification."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2e0f2f1c-1190-41ec-ab1f-0c6d9cd23eab",
                        "source_entry_id": "9eb4bf22-7828-39af-a061-3864974d8bec",
                        "source_sense_id": "be531c89-9be7-3ba5-a833-7df7c6fcc176",
                        "target_lang_word": "ampélographie",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "ampélographie",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "20c20682-7256-3656-8d93-7a3ab0d95f82",
                                        "entry_id": "f1ecc219-607c-3c44-ae2d-6365da9f142d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Description de la vigne."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Viticulture"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "81fd857c-82ba-47c7-8748-4c71fae6cc36",
                                                "sense_id": "20c20682-7256-3656-8d93-7a3ab0d95f82",
                                                "text": "Les connaissances relatives aux variétés de vignes étaient alors bien peu avancées, car on ne cite qu’un seul ouvrage d’ampélographie, composé par le sénateur Pétrus Crescentius. — (De l’Alimentation publique. — La Vigne. — I. — La Treille et le Raisin de table, 1860, p. 962-983)"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b92fac1b-6b91-3a9d-b4a1-d59bbd99e489",
                                        "entry_id": "f1ecc219-607c-3c44-ae2d-6365da9f142d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Traité sur la vigne."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Viticulture"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fa734aa9-1528-47df-b126-c83c7457387a",
                                                "sense_id": "b92fac1b-6b91-3a9d-b4a1-d59bbd99e489",
                                                "text": "Pour que cette œuvre, pour laquelle l’éditeur n’a reculé devant aucun sacrifice et qu’il a de plus en plus étendue, soit complète, il ne reste à paraître que le tome I sur l’ampélographie générale."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
